  "description": "Generated from src/shared/systemPauseGuardVectors.ts by `npm run adblock:rules`; do not edit. Events in order; every `update` step carries the decision (`resume` / `none`) the guard must take. Java (SystemPauseGuardTest) and Swift (CI vector runner) run them like the TypeScript reference.",
